<template>
 <section class="estimated-recovery" :class="{'chart-mode':mode==='chart'}">
  <template v-if="mode==='process'">
   <div class="heading"><div><h3>供应链中断恢复风险 · 五模型实际拟合</h3><p>原始恢复区间 → 估计恢复分布 → 节点交付传播 → 本案条件缺料</p></div><span class="status">{{ library.provenance.included_nodes }}条节点观测 · {{ library.provenance.root_incidents }}组根事件</span></div>
   <p class="method-family-note">支撑方法：可靠性与生存分析。以下估计节点中断后的恢复时间，作为整链模型的恢复参数输入。</p>
   <div class="model-picker" role="group" aria-label="真实恢复数据拟合的五种风险模型"><div v-for="(m,i) in library.models" :key="m.id" class="model-choice"><button :class="{active:m.id===model.id}" :aria-pressed="m.id===model.id" @click="update('recoveryModel',m.id)"><small>RECOVERY 0{{ i+1 }}</small><strong>{{ m.short }}</strong><span>{{ m.kind }}</span><em>已分别拟合 · {{ m.fitted.fit.converged?'收敛':'未收敛' }}</em></button><details class="method-source" :data-model-source="m.id"><summary>{{ m.short }} · 方法来源</summary><div v-if="m.method_source" class="source-body"><p class="source-family">{{ m.method_source.family }}</p><ol><li v-for="r in m.method_source.references" :key="r.url"><a :href="r.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ r.title }} ↗</a><p>{{ [r.authors,r.year,r.publisher].filter(Boolean).join(' · ') }} · {{ r.type }}</p></li></ol><p><b>本案用途：</b>{{ m.method_source.application }}</p><p>{{ m.method_source.implementation }}</p><p class="source-boundary">{{ m.method_source.boundary }}</p></div><a v-else :href="m.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方方法来源 ↗</a></details></div></div>
   <div class="controls"><label>采购安排 <select aria-label="恢复模型过程采购方案" :value="plan.id" @change="update('recoveryPlan',$event.target.value)"><option v-for="p in library.plans" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ p.label }}</option></select></label><label>条件情景 <select aria-label="恢复模型过程情景" :value="event.id" @change="update('recoveryEvent',$event.target.value)"><option v-for="e in library.events" :key="e.id" :value="e.id">{{ e.label }}</option></select></label></div>
   <div class="input-strip"><span><b>{{ library.provenance.included_nodes }}</b> 条真实观测</span><span><b>{{ library.provenance.day_exact }}</b> 条日级日期差</span><span><b>{{ library.provenance.interval_observations }}</b> 条日期区间</span><span><b>3</b> 个事件特征</span><span><b>{{ library.bootstrap.requested }}</b> 次事件分组重采样</span><span><b>{{ model.validation.chronological.groups }}</b> 组时间验证</span></div>
   <div class="calculation-route" aria-label="模型计算顺序"><span>① 读取恢复记录</span><i>→</i><span>② 拟合恢复时间</span><i>→</i><span>③ 换算库存缺口</span></div><div class="workbench"><section><small>01 · 真正参与估计的输入</small><h4>恢复区间与事件特征矩阵</h4><dl class="input-list"><div><dt>恢复目标</dt><dd>每条记录的持续天数下界L、上界U，保留区间精度；不用公告日冒充恢复日。</dd></div><div><dt>事件特征X</dt><dd>{{ model.id==='TURNBULL'?'当前Turnbull不使用X，只使用恢复区间与根事件权重，作为同目标非参数基线。':'矿山/上游组件、疫情原因、许可审批原因，共3个二元字段。' }}</dd></div><div><dt>共同根因与权重</dt><dd>{{ library.provenance.included_nodes }}个节点归为{{ library.provenance.root_incidents }}组；每组总权重1，上下游共同留出。</dd></div><div><dt>可知日期</dt><dd>恢复证据公布日用于时间验证，月份/年份取保守的月末/年末。</dd></div></dl><p>本情景 X＝[{{ event.x.join(', ') }}]；{{ event.exposure==='all'?'旧单和新增单共同暴露':event.exposure==='new'?'仅新增订单暴露':'未发生中断' }}。国别和公司名称保留作来源，不伪装成已估计的国别效应。</p></section><section><small>02 · 实际求解与参数</small><h4>{{ model.label }}</h4><code>{{ model.formula }}</code><p>在同一批真实区间上分别求解：参数模型优化带收缩的加权似然，Turnbull优化非参数区间似然；不把区间中点当真实恢复日。{{ model.id==='TURNBULL'?'Turnbull为无协变量非参数基线，直接估计概率质量。':'β采用N(0,1)收缩；这是明确的模型设定，参数由区间数据拟合。' }}</p><div class="parameter-grid"><div v-for="p in parameterRows" :key="p.name"><span>{{ p.name }}</span><b>{{ p.value }}</b></div></div><a :href="model.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">方法原始论文／官方文档 ↗</a><details><summary>完整拟合参数与求解状态</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(model.fitted,null,2) }}</pre></details></section><section><small>03 · 模型估计后再计算缺料</small><h4>条件期望最大缺料</h4><strong class="big">{{ fmt(result.expected_maximum_gap) }}<small> tU</small></strong><dl><div><dt>重采样P10—P90</dt><dd>{{ result.bootstrap_p10_p90.map(v=>fmt(v)).join('—') }} tU</dd></div><div><dt>70天内恢复等待均值¹</dt><dd>{{ event.id==='nominal'?'不适用':fmt(result.restricted_mean_days_70)+' 天' }}</dd></div><div><dt>第5天仍未恢复</dt><dd>{{ event.id==='nominal'?'不适用':fmt(result.probability_still_closed_day5*100)+'%' }}</dd></div><div><dt>期望缺料天数</dt><dd>{{ fmt(result.expected_shortage_days) }} 天</dd></div><div><dt>时间验证区间对数损失↓</dt><dd>{{ fmt(model.validation.chronological.mean_interval_log_loss,3) }}</dd></div></dl><p>¹超过70天部分截至70天。缺料概率仅以“该节点已经中断”为条件，不能当作事故发生概率。</p></section></div>
   <details class="data-details"><summary>输入明细：{{ library.provenance.included_nodes }}条真实训练记录、区间、特征和来源</summary><p>每组权重总和为1。只用已确认实际重启的组件记录；预计恢复、整站爬坡和计划性商业停产已筛除；重复报道去重，同根节点按组降权。</p><div class="table-wrap data-table"><table><thead><tr><th>节点／根事件</th><th>中断开始区间</th><th>已确认重启区间</th><th>持续时间L—U</th><th>X：上游/疫情/许可</th><th>证据可知日期</th><th>原始来源</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="e in library.training_events" :key="e.id"><th>{{ e.label }}<small>{{ e.group }}</small></th><td>{{ interval(e.start_lower,e.start_upper) }}</td><td>{{ interval(e.recovery_lower,e.recovery_upper) }}</td><td>{{ e.lower }}—{{ e.upper }} 天</td><td>[{{ e.x.join(',') }}]</td><td>{{ e.available_date || '未知；不进入时间训练' }}</td><td><a :href="e.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">中断 ↗</a><a :href="e.recovery_source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">重启 ↗</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
   <details><summary>缺料计算输入：案例库存、需求、订单和交付传播规则</summary><div class="case-input"><p>决策日2026-10-22；剩余需求240 tU／70天（10-23—12-31）；库存80 tU；旧单11-10到30 tU、12-10到40 tU；期末目标40 tU。新增{{ schedule(plan) }}。</p><code>对每种模型：E[L]=Σd P模型(T=d|X) · maxₜ max(0,−Iₜ(d))；Iₜ=80+累计可用到货−(240/70)·天数</code><p>从11月10日起作节点中断检验，受影响到货等待节点重启。逐一计算1—70天及更长尾部，再用拟合概率精确加权；未预先指定26/13/17天，也未随机添加图形噪声。</p><p>{{ library.mapping }}</p></div></details>
   <details><summary>检验明细：只用事发前公开数据的时间验证，以及根事件留组验证</summary><div class="validation-tabs"><button :class="{active:validationMode==='time'}" @click="validationMode='time'">按公开日期验证</button><button :class="{active:validationMode==='group'}" @click="validationMode='group'">根事件留组交叉验证</button></div><p>{{ library.validation_scope }} 留组交叉验证使用整个截止日前数据，仅检验跨事件泛化，不冒充历史时点预测。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>留出根事件</th><th>预测原点</th><th>训练证据最晚公开</th><th>真实时间区间</th><th>预测中位天数</th><th>区间对数损失↓</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="f in validationRows" :key="f.id"><th>{{ f.held_out_group }}</th><td>{{ f.origin||'留组验证' }}</td><td>{{ f.latest_training_publication||'非时间切分' }}</td><td>{{ f.lower }}—{{ f.upper }}天</td><td>{{ f.predicted_median_days||'>3650' }}</td><td>{{ fmt(f.interval_log_loss,3) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
   <p class="boundary">{{ library.validation_scope }} {{ library.assumptions }}</p>
  </template>
  <template v-else>
   <div class="plot-title"><span class="plot-index">01</span><div><h4>节点中断后，五模型估计会缺多少？</h4><p>7种情景 × 5个独立拟合的恢复分布 · 条件风险</p></div></div>
   <div class="controls"><label>采购安排 <select aria-label="图一恢复风险采购方案" :value="plan.id" @change="update('recoveryPlan',$event.target.value)"><option v-for="p in library.plans" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ p.label }}</option></select></label><button class="reset" aria-label="恢复风险图原方案" @click="update('recoveryPlan','staged130')">原方案</button><label>纵轴 <select aria-label="图一恢复风险指标" :value="context.recoveryMetric" @change="update('recoveryMetric',$event.target.value)"><option value="expected_maximum_gap">期望最大缺料 · tU</option><option value="expected_shortage_days">期望缺料天数 · 天</option><option value="conditional_shortage_probability">条件缺料概率 · %</option></select></label></div>
   <div ref="plot" class="recovery-chart" role="img" :aria-label="'七种情景下五个真实拟合恢复模型的'+metric.label+'对比'"></div>
   <p class="axis-note"><b>横轴：</b>中断发生后的节点与原因情景；<b>纵轴：</b>{{ metric.definition }}。<b>颜色：</b>五个恢复风险模型。各模型先估计恢复分布，再经统一物料平衡换算，不共用固定恢复天数。</p>
   <div class="selection"><b>{{ event.label }} · 五模型 {{ fmt(Math.min(...values)) }}—{{ fmt(Math.max(...values)) }} {{ metric.unit }}</b><p>根据{{ library.provenance.included_nodes }}条观测／{{ library.provenance.root_incidents }}组事件拟合，样本少，须同时查看检验误差。物流采用运营节点恢复代理，不是中哈铁路逐票履约概率。</p></div>
   <details class="numbers"><summary>查看五模型数值、重采样范围及恢复分布</summary><div class="controls"><label>查看情景 <select aria-label="图一恢复风险详情情景" :value="event.id" @change="update('recoveryEvent',$event.target.value)"><option v-for="e in library.events" :key="e.id" :value="e.id">{{ e.label }}</option></select></label></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>期望缺料tU</th><th>重采样P10—P90</th><th>第5天未恢复</th><th>时间验证损失↓</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in library.models" :key="m.id"><th>{{ m.short }}</th><td>{{ fmt(selected.models[m.id].expected_maximum_gap) }}</td><td>{{ selected.models[m.id].bootstrap_p10_p90.map(v=>fmt(v)).join('—') }}</td><td>{{ fmt(selected.models[m.id].probability_still_closed_day5*100) }}%</td><td>{{ fmt(m.validation.chronological.mean_interval_log_loss,3) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>{{ event.id==='nominal'?'基准未加入中断，无需估计恢复时间；任何缺料均来自采购安排本身。':'下图纵轴为“中断后到第d天仍未恢复”的估计概率，横轴为已中断天数。它是缺料柱高的实际概率输入。' }}</p><div ref="survivalElement" class="survival-chart" role="img" aria-label="所选情景五模型估计的恢复生存曲线"></div><p>{{ library.interpretation }}</p><p>{{ library.target }}</p><div class="table-wrap matrix"><table><thead><tr><th>全部情景 · {{ metric.unit }}</th><th v-for="m in library.models" :key="m.id">{{ m.short }}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="e in library.events" :key="e.id"><th>{{ e.label }}</th><td v-for="m in library.models" :key="m.id">{{ fmt(transform(plan.events.find(r=>r.event_id===e.id).models[m.id][context.recoveryMetric])) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
  </template>
 </section>
</template>

<script setup>
import {computed,ref,watch,nextTick,onMounted,onUnmounted} from 'vue'
import * as echarts from 'echarts'
const props=defineProps({library:{type:Object,required:true},modelValue:{type:Object,required:true},mode:{type:String,default:'chart'}})
const emit=defineEmits(['update:modelValue'])
const context=computed(()=>({recoveryPlan:'staged130',recoveryEvent:'logistics_technical',recoveryModel:'WEIBULL_AFT',recoveryMetric:'expected_maximum_gap',...props.modelValue}))
const plan=computed(()=>props.library.plans.find(p=>p.id===context.value.recoveryPlan)||props.library.plans[0])
const event=computed(()=>props.library.events.find(e=>e.id===context.value.recoveryEvent)||props.library.events[3])
const model=computed(()=>props.library.models.find(m=>m.id===context.value.recoveryModel)||props.library.models[0])
const selected=computed(()=>plan.value.events.find(e=>e.event_id===event.value.id))
const result=computed(()=>selected.value.models[model.value.id])
const metrics={expected_maximum_gap:{label:'条件期望最大缺料',unit:'tU',definition:'若该节点发生中断，本案70天内最大累计欠料的期望值（tU金属铀）'},expected_shortage_days:{label:'期望缺料天数',unit:'天',definition:'若该节点发生中断，本案出现日末欠料天数的期望（天）'},conditional_shortage_probability:{label:'条件缺料概率',unit:'%',definition:'在该节点已经中断、且暴露订单等待重启的条件下，本案任一天缺料的估计概率（%）'}}
const metric=computed(()=>metrics[context.value.recoveryMetric]||metrics.expected_maximum_gap)
const transform=v=>context.value.recoveryMetric==='conditional_shortage_probability'?v*100:v
const values=computed(()=>props.library.models.map(m=>transform(selected.value.models[m.id][context.value.recoveryMetric])))
const fmt=(v,d=2)=>v==null?'—':Number(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:d})
const interval=(a,b)=>a===b?a:a+'—'+b
const schedule=p=>p.new_receipts.map(r=>`${r.date.slice(5)}可用${r.quantity} tU`).join('；')
function update(key,value){emit('update:modelValue',{...context.value,[key]:value})}
const validationMode=ref('time')
const validationRows=computed(()=>validationMode.value==='time'?model.value.validation.chronological.folds:model.value.validation.folds)
const parameterRows=computed(()=>{const m=model.value,p=m.fitted.parameters;if(m.id==='TURNBULL')return [{name:'非零概率支持日',value:m.fitted.mass.filter(v=>v>1e-6).length},{name:'EM迭代',value:m.fitted.fit.iterations},{name:'训练区间负对数似然',value:fmt(m.fitted.fit.negative_log_likelihood,3)}];if(m.id==='PIECEWISE_PH')return p.map((v,i)=>({name:i<5?'λ'+(i+1)+' /天':'β'+(i-4),value:fmt(i<5?Math.exp(v):v,4)}));return [{name:'基准尺度 exp(β₀)',value:fmt(Math.exp(p[0]),3)+' 天'},...p.slice(1,4).map((v,i)=>({name:'β · '+props.library.features[i],value:fmt(v,4)})),{name:m.id==='WEIBULL_AFT'?'形状 k':'log T 尺度',value:fmt(Math.exp(p[4]),4)}]})
const plot=ref(null),survivalElement=ref(null),colors=['#3264df','#029987','#d69a17','#8a5ccf','#d66078']
let chart,survivalChart,observer,alive=true
const base={animation:false,color:colors,textStyle:{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif',fontSize:10,color:'#6b7f97'}}
async function render(){await nextTick();if(!alive||props.mode!=='chart')return
 if(plot.value?.clientWidth){chart ||= echarts.init(plot.value);chart.setOption({...base,legend:{top:0,left:2,itemWidth:10,itemHeight:8,textStyle:{fontSize:10},data:props.library.models.map(m=>m.short)},grid:{left:48,right:12,top:64,bottom:53},tooltip:{trigger:'axis',confine:true,textStyle:{fontSize:11},axisPointer:{type:'shadow'},formatter:params=>{if(!params.length)return '';const e=props.library.events[params[0].dataIndex];return `<b>${e.label}</b><br>`+params.map(p=>`${p.marker}${p.seriesName}：${fmt(p.value)} ${metric.value.unit}`).join('<br>')}},xAxis:{type:'category',data:props.library.events.map(e=>e.axis_label),axisTick:{show:false},axisLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#d8e1eb'}},axisLabel:{interval:0,fontSize:9,lineHeight:14}},yAxis:{type:'value',name:metric.value.label+'（'+metric.value.unit+'）',nameTextStyle:{fontSize:10},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf1f6'}}},series:props.library.models.map(m=>({name:m.short,type:'bar',barMaxWidth:11,barGap:'10%',itemStyle:{borderRadius:[2,2,0,0]},data:plan.value.events.map(e=>transform(e.models[m.id][context.value.recoveryMetric]))}))},true);chart.off('click');chart.on('click',p=>update('recoveryEvent',props.library.events[p.dataIndex].id))}
 if(survivalElement.value?.clientWidth){survivalChart ||= echarts.init(survivalElement.value);survivalChart.setOption({...base,legend:{top:0,itemWidth:12,textStyle:{fontSize:9}},grid:{left:44,right:8,top:47,bottom:32},tooltip:{trigger:'axis',confine:true,valueFormatter:v=>fmt(v*100)+'%'},xAxis:{type:'category',data:Array.from({length:71},(_,i)=>i),name:'天',nameGap:3,axisLabel:{interval:9}},yAxis:{type:'value',min:0,max:1,name:'仍未恢复概率',axisLabel:{formatter:v=>fmt(v*100,0)+'%'},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf1f6'}}},series:props.library.models.map(m=>({name:m.short,type:'line',showSymbol:false,data:event.value.id==='nominal'?[]:selected.value.models[m.id].survival_days_0_70,lineStyle:{width:1.8},smooth:false}))},true)}
}
watch([()=>props.modelValue,()=>props.library],render,{deep:true})
onMounted(()=>{render();observer=new ResizeObserver(()=>{chart?.resize();survivalChart?.resize();render()});if(plot.value)observer.observe(plot.value);if(survivalElement.value)observer.observe(survivalElement.value)})
onUnmounted(()=>{alive=false;observer?.disconnect();chart?.dispose();survivalChart?.dispose()})
</script>

